+### `draft_vision_issue`
+
+Analyze a local screenshot with Cloudflare Vision AI and draft an issue report from it. It only returns draft text (a `TITLE:` and a `DESCRIPTION:` section); it does not submit anything. Pass the result to `submit_issue` yourself once the user has reviewed it.
